@page "/cookies"

<PageTitle>Cookie Policy | Pet Love Care</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-5 pt-5 pb-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-4"
        style="letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
        Cookie Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-10 text-secondary">
            <p>
                This page explains what cookies are and how to manage them
                when shopping at Pet Love Care.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h6 text-dark fw-bold text-uppercase mt-4">
                What Are Cookies?
            </h2>
            <p>
                Cookies are small pieces of data that a website can store in
                your browser. Online stores can use them to remember settings
                or support features such as signing in and checking out.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h6 text-dark fw-bold text-uppercase mt-4">
                Essential Cookies
            </h2>
            <p>
                Essential cookies help a website perform basic tasks, such as
                maintaining a session or protecting forms. Blocking these
                cookies may prevent some store features from working correctly.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-light border">
                <h2 class="h6 text-dark fw-bold text-uppercase">
                    Manage Cookies
                </h2>
                <p class="mb-0">
                    You can view, block, or delete cookies in your browser
                    settings. Clearing cookies may reset your session or
                    preferences.
                </p>
            </div>

            <p class="mt-4 mb-0">
                For more information, see our
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
                If you have questions, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>